Upstream fix that is merged but not in a release yet (planned for 1.35.0):

  fix: --ignore-indexing-state continues on FAILED "No index with requested name" (#1361)
  https://github.com/icloud-photos-downloader/icloud_photos_downloader/pull/1495
  merge commit 08f2e16b885f0721266f5e7c3123404358e5c683 (2026-11-23)

Only the two source files, with paths and line numbers of the icloudpd 1.34.0
wheel (the pull request is against src/ on master). Unchanged otherwise.

Why it is here: since 2026-11-17 Apple's indexing check for many personal
libraries answers FAILED ("No index with requested name:
CPLContainerRelation...") and then RUNNING, never FINISHED, although the
library lists completely. icloudpd 1.34.0's --ignore-indexing-state only
continues when every answer is RUNNING.

